WEBVTT

00:02.550 --> 00:04.017
Legend has it...

00:05.186 --> 00:07.984
...that during the Heian Period, there
were men who fought with no weapons...

00:08.322 --> 00:13.487
They were known as the Men of
Carnage and they reigned undefeated.

00:15.129 --> 00:20.089
Their technique was called
the Mutsu Enmei Style.

00:33.414 --> 00:40.843
<i>The Age of Chaos
Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

00:41.089 --> 00:46.959
<i>Rushing through my innocent
youth without a care in the world.</i>

00:48.496 --> 00:54.401
<i>This soul of mine is
so easy to influence.</i>

00:56.070 --> 00:59.836
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

00:59.941 --> 01:03.138
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

01:06.914 --> 01:13.979
<i>This is what I'm wishing
for as I sing this song.</i>

01:14.155 --> 01:19.991
<i>I want you to acknowledge
me, that's all.</i>

01:20.862 --> 01:28.064
<i>You smiled at me for
the very first time.</i>

01:28.336 --> 01:36.710
<i>Thank you so much, thank you
from the bottom of my heart.</i>

01:37.411 --> 01:39.072
<i>I'll never forget it.</i>

01:48.823 --> 01:52.259
<i>The Age of Chaos
Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

02:17.218 --> 02:18.276
Stop it right now!

02:21.455 --> 02:23.252
Princess Yukihime!

02:28.663 --> 02:35.091
<i>The Shadows Strike</i>

03:04.332 --> 03:06.300
My, what an appetite you have!

03:07.802 --> 03:09.599
Yes, these are great!

03:14.108 --> 03:15.405
Wow!

03:16.377 --> 03:18.311
I wonder where it all goes?

03:18.412 --> 03:20.539
I mean, he just had
all those dumplings too!

03:20.648 --> 03:22.479
Yakumo, you're amazing!

03:23.784 --> 03:25.945
By the way, who are you?

03:26.687 --> 03:27.984
My name is...

03:28.322 --> 03:29.482
My name is...

03:29.657 --> 03:32.751
My name's Iori. I'm
Musashi Miyamoto's disciple!

03:33.094 --> 03:35.688
And this here's Big Sister Shiori!

03:36.597 --> 03:39.896
Well, then, Shiori,
what are you to Yakumo?

03:40.868 --> 03:42.096
Well, I...

03:42.403 --> 03:45.861
I've been searching for Yakumo,
and I've finally reunited with him...

03:46.674 --> 03:48.005
What do you mean by that?

03:48.142 --> 03:50.337
Why were you looking for Yakumo?

03:51.312 --> 03:53.644
The reason I was looking
for Yakumo was because...

03:58.085 --> 04:00.645
Hey, if you wanted some,
you should've just asked!

04:00.755 --> 04:01.813
Here, have one!

04:02.390 --> 04:03.288
No, thanks.

04:03.624 --> 04:05.854
Oh, come on, you don't
have to put on airs.

04:05.960 --> 04:07.791
Even girls get hungry too!

04:08.129 --> 04:10.620
Wait a minute, you mean, you're a girl?

04:10.965 --> 04:14.901
You're so scruffy-looking,
I had no idea!

04:15.603 --> 04:18.595
Well, if you're a girl, you'd better
take better care of your appearance.

04:18.873 --> 04:20.465
Or you'll never find a husband!

04:21.542 --> 04:24.443
I-I'm dressed like this because
I've been traveling alone.

04:25.546 --> 04:26.877
Really?

04:27.081 --> 04:29.413
Well, why were you looking for Yakumo?

04:30.184 --> 04:32.243
I was looking for Yakumo because...

04:32.653 --> 04:35.349
Yakumo is my...

04:35.456 --> 04:38.152
I was hired as her bodyguard, see!

04:49.370 --> 04:51.668
I see... is that all?

04:51.772 --> 04:54.900
Since you said you've been reunited
with Yakumo at last, I thought...

04:55.009 --> 04:56.772
...you were his fiancée, or something!

04:58.713 --> 05:00.305
Bodyguard, you say...

05:00.815 --> 05:03.340
Tell me, how much did this job pay?

05:05.686 --> 05:06.311
Fifteen mon.

05:07.088 --> 05:08.385
Fifteen mon?

05:08.756 --> 05:11.088
How many mons go into a ryo, I wonder?

05:11.625 --> 05:14.958
All right, then! I
shall pay you 100 ryo.

05:15.329 --> 05:17.797
Yakumo, I'm hiring you
to become my bodyguard!

05:18.065 --> 05:19.965
That's a cushy offer.

05:20.267 --> 05:21.757
How many dumplings can I buy with that?

05:25.973 --> 05:27.201
Then it's settled!

05:27.842 --> 05:28.638
Kanae!

05:28.743 --> 05:29.505
Yes?

05:32.580 --> 05:33.274
Is that clear?

05:33.381 --> 05:34.814
Yes, Your Highness.

05:41.489 --> 05:42.717
Don't be shy, now.

05:42.823 --> 05:43.949
For me?

05:44.658 --> 05:45.886
There's 20 ryo there.

05:46.160 --> 05:48.924
Use it to hire yourself
another bodyguard.

05:50.998 --> 05:53.330
Or perhaps you'd prefer this instead?

05:53.434 --> 05:54.230
Kanae!

06:01.175 --> 06:02.802
Beautiful, isn't it?

06:10.651 --> 06:11.982
So pretty...

06:16.424 --> 06:17.550
Do you want it?

06:17.658 --> 06:19.057
If you want it, it's yours.

06:21.796 --> 06:22.990
No, thank you.

06:24.365 --> 06:26.026
It's a hand-me-down.

06:26.133 --> 06:28.124
You're quite welcome to it.

06:35.443 --> 06:36.705
Well, then...

06:37.611 --> 06:38.839
Thanks for the refreshments!

06:41.882 --> 06:43.281
My! You ate it all?

06:43.984 --> 06:44.746
Yes!

06:52.026 --> 06:55.655
Very well, Yakumo! Tonight I'm
going to welcome you with a banquet!

06:56.263 --> 06:58.458
We have the best seafood here in Aki!

06:59.233 --> 07:00.632
Wow, that's something
to look forward to!

07:04.405 --> 07:05.030
Kanae!

07:05.139 --> 07:05.867
Yes?

07:06.207 --> 07:07.902
We're putting up all three
of them for the night.

07:08.042 --> 07:10.510
And all three will be
there for tonight's banquet.

07:10.611 --> 07:11.976
As you wish, Your Highness.

07:16.183 --> 07:18.310
You may use this guesthouse as you like.

07:19.954 --> 07:21.512
All right!

07:22.756 --> 07:27.193
Hey, guys, the three of
us should sleep in a row!

07:27.495 --> 07:28.427
Huh?

07:28.863 --> 07:30.888
I don't think we should do that...

07:30.998 --> 07:32.260
I guess not.

07:32.366 --> 07:36.166
Then Big Brother and I will sleep here,
and Big Sister Shiori can sleep next door.

07:36.937 --> 07:39.303
We're going to need two
mattresses in this room...

07:39.573 --> 07:40.972
Do whatever you want.

07:42.009 --> 07:43.442
You may use the bathhouse now.

07:44.111 --> 07:45.135
A bath, huh?

07:45.546 --> 07:48.413
I want to take a bath with
you, Big Brother Yakumo!

07:48.816 --> 07:49.646
Sure.

07:58.392 --> 07:59.620
Welcome!

07:59.727 --> 08:01.024
Please, this way...

08:03.063 --> 08:03.961
Did you hear?

08:04.064 --> 08:05.861
Yes, the whole dojo was
brought to its knees.

08:05.966 --> 08:07.263
It wasn't even a challenge.

08:07.401 --> 08:09.266
They took him to the dojo
to teach him a lesson...

08:09.370 --> 08:10.860
...but he ended up defeating them all.

08:12.273 --> 08:14.366
Those stinking Kuki Musou Style cowards!

08:14.742 --> 08:18.337
Always swaggering because
the Palace chose their Style...

08:19.046 --> 08:21.810
But they can only swing their
swords in their own dojo!

08:23.017 --> 08:24.279
You got that right!

08:29.456 --> 08:31.424
I'd like to meet a man of such power...

08:32.626 --> 08:33.388
Who are you?

08:35.629 --> 08:37.392
Just one of the Kuki family.

08:38.432 --> 08:40.366
Genjiro Kuki!

08:41.502 --> 08:43.026
Kuki's second son!

08:43.771 --> 08:44.635
Well, what if he is?

09:09.630 --> 09:10.927
Oh, my God!

09:15.302 --> 09:17.270
Old man, sorry to cause you trouble.

09:17.371 --> 09:18.770
N-Not at all...

09:28.749 --> 09:32.241
So I guess they must be
yearning for my skills now...

09:36.957 --> 09:37.946
Idiot!

09:38.492 --> 09:41.154
Allowing not just our disciples, but
even the Assistant Instructor to be...

09:41.261 --> 09:42.922
...defeated by a stranger!

09:43.430 --> 09:46.126
I'm amazed you have the gall to face me!

09:46.834 --> 09:49.803
Shinzaburo, how can you be so calm?

09:50.371 --> 09:54.501
And to make matters worse, Princess
Yuki witnessed the whole debacle!

09:54.708 --> 09:57.370
That means it won't be long
before her father hears of this...

10:01.281 --> 10:05.843
Elder Brother, working yourself into a
rage isn't going to restore our reputation.

10:07.287 --> 10:11.986
We need to focus on finding a way to
lure this man into a confrontation...

10:12.092 --> 10:13.286
...and defeat him!

10:13.527 --> 10:15.757
That goes without saying.

10:16.130 --> 10:20.089
But I hear that he's staying in
the palace with Princess Yuki.

10:21.568 --> 10:25.732
Well, you can leave the matter
of drawing him out to me...

10:26.740 --> 10:30.904
Just focus on your mental
preparation for now, Elder Brother...

10:31.011 --> 10:32.945
Right, right, I'm counting on you!

10:33.180 --> 10:33.703
All right.

10:40.821 --> 10:42.379
Is that you, Brother Genjiro?

10:42.790 --> 10:44.382
I didn't know you'd come home...

10:45.225 --> 10:48.353
Well, I thought you'd be
needing my skills soon enough.

10:49.930 --> 10:51.830
Elder Brother, the
art of war is not just...

10:51.932 --> 10:54.332
...about comparing one's
skills as an individual.

10:55.035 --> 10:56.696
So you don't need me...

10:56.837 --> 10:59.931
...because you're going to
use ninjas in a sneak attack...

11:00.240 --> 11:04.176
Or are you planning to gather some
troops and fight with muskets instead?

11:04.678 --> 11:08.045
How to ultimately defeat your
enemy, formulating such a plan...

11:08.148 --> 11:10.275
...that is the art of war.

11:11.285 --> 11:12.445
Never mind.

11:12.986 --> 11:17.753
Eventually, your so-called plan will be
shattered, and then I'll come in to save you.

11:18.425 --> 11:21.360
Nothing would please me more
if that should come to pass...

11:21.495 --> 11:23.395
And when it does come to pass...

11:23.497 --> 11:25.727
...I'm certain that even
you won't emerge victorious.

11:47.121 --> 11:51.751
You can plan all you want, but
if your plan is full of holes...

11:52.292 --> 11:55.318
You really need to watch
your back, you know...

11:57.397 --> 12:00.696
His swordsmanship, if nothing
else, is still formidable.

12:03.771 --> 12:05.170
Such a shame...

12:22.489 --> 12:24.650
Are you still soaking, Big Brother?

12:25.092 --> 12:26.081
Uh-huh...

12:28.529 --> 12:32.090
Man, if you stay in there too
long you're going to melt away!

12:41.842 --> 12:43.935
Big Sister Shiori, why
don't you take a bath, too?

12:45.813 --> 12:47.110
It's really huge!

12:47.347 --> 12:48.609
It's like a spa.

12:48.882 --> 12:51.817
This may be a guesthouse, but
you can tell it's a daimyo's bath...

12:52.119 --> 12:53.518
It's a private spa!

12:55.455 --> 12:58.253
Hey, what's the matter?
You don't seem very happy...

13:00.727 --> 13:03.753
If you don't watch out, she's
going to steal Big Brother from you!

13:04.364 --> 13:08.460
That princess is head over
heels in love with Big Brother.

13:09.169 --> 13:13.071
Really, you've got to be
more aggressive, Big Sister!

13:13.841 --> 13:14.865
But...

13:15.375 --> 13:17.400
Oh, don't give me that!

13:17.878 --> 13:20.312
So what if she's the
daughter of a daimyo?

13:20.480 --> 13:22.573
You can't let her win his heart, too!

13:23.283 --> 13:26.684
I'm so ashamed of myself...

13:26.820 --> 13:27.718
But why?

13:28.455 --> 13:31.447
When she said she'd give
me that beautiful kimono...

13:31.558 --> 13:33.423
I wavered for just a second.

13:33.794 --> 13:36.627
I wanted Yakumo to see me all
dressed up in a beautiful kimono...

13:36.730 --> 13:38.391
...like the girl I'm supposed to be...

13:38.532 --> 13:42.195
And Princess Yuki knew
exactly what I was feeling!

13:44.137 --> 13:46.765
It must be really hard to be a girl...

13:47.641 --> 13:51.168
Well, if you go take a bath and wash all
that dirt off you, you'll be pretty, too!

13:52.980 --> 13:55.278
But I'll never hold a
candle to that Princess Yuki...

13:55.415 --> 13:57.144
A sunburned face can't grow fair...

13:57.651 --> 14:01.678
Not only that, but even if I did become
fair and put on a beautiful kimono...

14:02.556 --> 14:04.148
...I know I wouldn't be
able to pull it off.

14:04.258 --> 14:06.749
I was raised as a boy and
I can't break those habits...

14:07.160 --> 14:09.890
I'll never be feminine, I'll never
light up a room with my beauty...

14:10.197 --> 14:12.131
I can never become a woman like that!

14:12.966 --> 14:16.094
And Yakumo, he'll never be
anything but my bodyguard...

14:18.572 --> 14:22.235
But hey, I'm sure he knows
how you feel, Big Sister!

14:22.776 --> 14:24.710
Thank you, but...

14:25.479 --> 14:28.676
If you can't ask him yourself,
then I'll ask him for you! Okay?

14:39.059 --> 14:42.460
You are not to kill this man,
all you have to do is wound him.

14:42.896 --> 14:45.057
Just take away his strength.

14:45.465 --> 14:46.932
The master will deliver
the coup de grace...

14:47.267 --> 14:49.462
He will strike him down in front of all.

14:50.070 --> 14:53.801
I see, so this is
Shinzaburo's plan of attack.

14:53.941 --> 14:55.841
Underhanded as usual...

14:55.943 --> 14:57.205
...no, I mean brilliant!

14:57.577 --> 14:58.168
What?

14:59.846 --> 15:03.145
We work in the shadow
of the Kuki Musou School.

15:03.383 --> 15:06.477
We wish for the well-being of
the School as much as anyone else...

15:11.024 --> 15:13.618
Oh, I'm stuffed, I'm stuffed!

15:14.094 --> 15:17.257
I've never eaten such great
food in my entire life!

15:17.965 --> 15:19.364
Well, how is it?

15:19.466 --> 15:21.331
Hmm!

15:22.235 --> 15:24.999
Now, here's some European
cake. Taste that, will you?

15:27.040 --> 15:28.007
Is it good?

15:28.141 --> 15:29.165
It's good, isn't it?

15:29.376 --> 15:30.673
Here, have some more!

15:32.913 --> 15:36.679
Wow, that Princess Yuki's all
over Big Brother Yakumo, isn't she?

15:39.286 --> 15:42.153
Really, you're such a
mysterious man, Yakumo...

15:42.522 --> 15:45.150
I could stare at you all
day and never get bored!

15:45.525 --> 15:49.621
Really, most men are shallow and
obsequious, and I can't stand them!

15:49.763 --> 15:51.025
Hmmm?

15:51.131 --> 15:52.996
But you're different, Yakumo!

15:53.266 --> 15:58.067
You seem to float, just like your name.
I have no idea what you're thinking!

16:00.674 --> 16:04.007
That's exactly what I find so
appealing about you, Yakumo!

16:05.912 --> 16:07.209
And how do you feel, Yakumo?

16:07.314 --> 16:08.440
Do you like me?

16:08.548 --> 16:09.879
Hmm, yummy...

16:10.217 --> 16:10.951
Really! You do like me?

16:10.951 --> 16:13.419
Big Sister Shiori? Where are you going?
Really! You do like me?

16:14.087 --> 16:16.715
Oh, it's delicious, isn't it?

16:21.495 --> 16:23.656
Why in the world did I come after him?

16:23.764 --> 16:25.197
Because I wanted to see him...

16:25.298 --> 16:29.667
I thought that if I could just see Yakumo
again, he'd be waiting for me, too...

16:30.437 --> 16:31.631
I'm such a fool!

16:33.473 --> 16:36.033
You'll make a fine woman for sure.

16:37.978 --> 16:41.505
But Yakumo never said that he
had feelings for me, not once!

16:41.882 --> 16:44.942
I just assumed...

16:54.694 --> 16:55.524
Is it good?

16:56.229 --> 16:57.719
For crying out loud!

16:59.866 --> 17:00.423
Hey!

17:00.534 --> 17:01.865
Come on, come on!

17:01.968 --> 17:02.593
What is it?

17:02.702 --> 17:03.236
Just come with me!

17:03.236 --> 17:03.634
<i>Hey...</i>
Just come with me!

17:03.737 --> 17:04.931
What is going on?

17:05.238 --> 17:07.103
You're coming right back, aren't you?

17:07.240 --> 17:09.037
I have more sweets for you...

17:09.142 --> 17:09.904
Yeah.

17:10.944 --> 17:12.172
Are you blind?

17:12.679 --> 17:15.876
Can't you think about how
Big Sister Shiori is feeling?

17:16.216 --> 17:17.080
I should think about her?

17:17.184 --> 17:18.082
Oh, man!

17:18.585 --> 17:22.021
Big Sister left her home, and
traveled all this way by herself.

17:22.289 --> 17:24.018
She went through so much...

17:24.524 --> 17:27.584
That's how much she wanted
to see you again, Big Brother!

17:34.968 --> 17:37.368
Come on! Are you listening
to me, Big Brother?

17:37.471 --> 17:39.371
Yeah, I heard you.

17:39.506 --> 17:42.134
I want you to go back inside
and keep the Princess company.

17:42.375 --> 17:44.502
Are you going to go talk
to Big Sister Shiori?

17:44.845 --> 17:45.937
I gotta piss...

17:46.179 --> 17:46.907
Huh?

17:49.182 --> 17:50.581
Oh, come on, what are you doing?

17:56.223 --> 17:58.885
I'll go home...

17:59.159 --> 18:02.856
I'll become a nun, and tend to
the graves of my parents and Jii...

18:03.163 --> 18:04.528
...that's how I'll live...

18:22.315 --> 18:23.213
Wait...

18:25.552 --> 18:26.576
Listen to me.

18:26.820 --> 18:29.812
I don't want to cause
any trouble for my host...

18:30.056 --> 18:32.422
...and I'm sure you don't want
to cause a commotion, either.

18:33.560 --> 18:34.356
Okay?

18:34.794 --> 18:35.988
Let's do this somewhere else.

18:59.152 --> 19:00.881
Did he run into the bamboo grove?

19:02.589 --> 19:05.456
That's a sure way to
escape our shurikens...

19:06.560 --> 19:08.357
However, that may prove...

19:51.271 --> 19:52.431
We got him!

19:52.572 --> 19:55.564
If he hadn't resisted he could've
gotten off with a few scratches...

19:58.612 --> 19:59.374
What the hell!

20:41.454 --> 20:42.921
Hey, this is really good!

20:43.223 --> 20:44.190
This is boring!

20:44.324 --> 20:47.259
It's unbearably boring to
watch you eat instead of Yakumo!

20:48.261 --> 20:50.991
Really, now! Where in
the world is Yakumo?

20:51.097 --> 20:52.325
Yakumo!

20:52.966 --> 20:56.732
I hope Big Brother went to
talk to Big Sister Shiori...

21:00.874 --> 21:02.102
Shiori...

21:08.048 --> 21:10.573
Yakumo, farewell...

21:16.356 --> 21:21.293
<i>To be continued...</i>

21:32.439 --> 21:44.476
<i>Those summer stars, I looked up at
them alone when I was a troubled child.</i>

21:44.751 --> 21:54.490
<i>My loneliness and the vast night
sky, melting and shining in eternity.</i>

21:54.627 --> 22:03.626
<i>I just don't know what this
dream means, if it leads to love...</i>

22:03.770 --> 22:14.442
<i>Even if it's just "hello,"
I want to hear your voice.</i>

22:15.482 --> 22:21.614
<i>The person I am today
is about to disappear...</i>

22:21.988 --> 22:24.980
<i>What is it that will hold me back?</i>

22:25.859 --> 22:32.128
<i>Will it be you? I won't ask you now.</i>

22:32.432 --> 22:37.927
<i>Maybe if we ever meet again...</i>

22:52.852 --> 22:56.845
The entire Kuki Musou Style School
has come out in force to entrap Yakumo...

22:57.123 --> 22:59.421
And this man awaits him as well!

23:00.393 --> 23:04.022
Next episode of the Age of Chaos,
"Fight to the Death at Sanbonmatsu."

23:04.464 --> 23:06.227
Pay close attention, and wait!
